# Force of Vigor: "If it's not your turn, you may exile a green card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost."
# On Bot2's own turn 2 the alternative cost is not offered even though an Elvish Mystic (a green card) is in its hand
# (the refusal; the positive control is the same cast on Bot1's turn in force-of-vigor-exiles-a-green-card-to-destroy-
# two-artifacts-on-the-opponents-turn), so it pays {2}{G}{G} with a Mox Emerald and a Black Lotus and destroys Bot1's
# Mox Sapphire. The Mystic stays in the hand.

